  "query_preview": "..\nIssued 447 PM CDT Sun Jul 26 2026\n\nTuesday through Sunday:\n\nHigh swim risk may develop Tuesday and continue through Tuesday\nnight at Lake Michigan beaches due to northerly winds and\nbuilding waves and associated currents. Use caution and stay out\nof the water!\n\nDry conditions and more seasonable temperatures return Tuesday\ninto Thursday with highs in the 80s. Friday through Saturday, \nlow pressure developing in the Plains will bring the next \nchances for storms to the region as shortwaves ride through the \ndecaying ridging. Expecting a return to high pressure on Sunday.\n\nMH",
